  "title": "Bump upload-artifact to v7.0.2 across CI and review workflows",
  "summary": "A dependency-only change: every `actions/upload-artifact` step in `.github/workflows/ci.yml` and `.github/workflows/review.yml` is repinned from commit `043fb46d` (v7.0.1) to `cf430e03` (v7.0.2). No step names, inputs, paths, conditions or job wiring change — only the action revision that receives the artifacts. The blast radius is therefore the whole artifact hand-off surface: the CI jobs that persist lint findings and checkpoint evidence, and the review pipeline that publishes the built `osf` binary, the work item, each reviewer's saved answers, and the aggregated SARIF findings.",
